        '@POS_BUTTONS bit output, @REDIMIR_PATROCINIO bit output, @POS_AD' +
        'D_BUTTONS bit output, @POS_TAB_CANCEL bit output,'
      
        '@POS_VER_TOTAL_CASH bit output, @POS_POST_SHOPPER bit output, @P' +
